From: WinBoat
Subject: [PATCH] d3d10umd, virgl: the WDDM 2.0 DDI and Direct3D 11.3's options

The D3D11 runtime reads the 11.3 options only from drivers on the WDDM 2.0 DDI, so the driver offers it last
(WINBOAT_D3D_WDDM2=0 leaves it out):
- the 2.0 table is the WDDM 1.3 one with longer arguments in seven places, each the old one with fields after it
  (views' plane slices: the plane still follows from the format; conservative rasterization: tier 0; a query's
  context type), Flush with a context type, and SetHardwareProtection(State), GetResourceLayout and
  RetrieveShaderComment; DXGI 1.4's table (TrimResidencySet, overlay color spaces: none); the 2.0 video table
  (SubmitDecoderBuffers1, StreamColorSpace1 as the 11.1 color space, format conversion checks, no downsampling,
  no content protection)
- caps: GPUVA_CAPS 40 bits (the runtime refuses 0: DXGI_ERROR_DRIVER_INTERNAL_ERROR for every device)
- typed UAV loads of more formats (D3DWDDM2_0DDI_FORMAT_SUPPORT_UAV_READS where UAV writes are: the shader
  variants already declare the bound view's format)
- SV_RenderTargetArrayIndex/SV_ViewportArrayIndex from vertex and domain shaders (OPTIONS3), with the host's
  VS_VERTEX_LAYER, VS_VIEWPORT_INDEX and WinBoat's TES_LAYER_VIEWPORT (virglrenderer 0016)
- oStencilRef (SV_StencilRef) when the host GL has ARB_shader_stencil_export (NVIDIA's has not: off there),
  written through a temporary and a MOV (virglrenderer converts integer instructions' results for integer
  outputs as floats)
- Map on default textures, which the runtime offers on this DDI: GetResourceLayout reports the texture row-major
  at the offsets and pitches of the virgl guest storage (virgl_resource_get_param STRIDE/OFFSET/LAYER_STRIDE) and
  its allocation; WriteToSubresource/ReadFromSubresource then go through the ordinary Map
diff --git a/src/gallium/drivers/virgl/virgl_resource.c b/src/gallium/drivers/virgl/virgl_resource.c
index c691c5a..8e211cb 100644
--- a/src/gallium/drivers/virgl/virgl_resource.c
+++ b/src/gallium/drivers/virgl/virgl_resource.c
@@ -838,6 +838,17 @@ virgl_resource_get_param(struct pipe_screen *screen,
    case PIPE_RESOURCE_PARAM_MODIFIER:
       *value = res->metadata.modifier;
       return true;
+   /* the guest storage's layout (WDDM 2.0's resource layouts: D3D11 maps on default textures) */
+   case PIPE_RESOURCE_PARAM_STRIDE:
+      *value = res->metadata.stride[level];
+      return true;
+   case PIPE_RESOURCE_PARAM_OFFSET:
+      *value = res->metadata.plane_offset + res->metadata.level_offset[level] +
+               (uint64_t)layer * res->metadata.layer_stride[level];
+      return true;
+   case PIPE_RESOURCE_PARAM_LAYER_STRIDE:
+      *value = res->metadata.layer_stride[level];
+      return true;
    default:
       return false;
    }
